{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>由 Yash Future Tech Solutions Pvt Ltd 開發的中世紀近戰格鬥動作遊戲 Gladiator Blades Of Fury，現於 Epic Games 平台<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，截止時間為 11 月 8 日 18:30（香港時間）。玩家可在遊戲中扮演來自不同氏族的角鬥士，以武器與技能在競技場上分出高下，體驗近身搏鬥的節奏與張力。</p>\n<p>遊戲背景設定於中世紀，玩家可從野蠻人、刺客、騎士及矮人四個氏族中選擇角鬥士，每個英雄均有專屬武器、技能與戰鬥風格。玩家目標是在錦標賽模式中過關斬將，爭奪冠軍角鬥士的頭銜；亦可透過快速對戰模式即時開局，磨練技巧。戰鬥中可使出武器連擊與慢動作招式，並在不同環境中學習戰鬥技巧。</p>\n<p>遊戲提供最多 20 名戰鬥風格各異的英雄、4 個氏族及 7 個可選環境，設有 3 種難度與 2 種遊戲模式，並支援多人遊玩。作品具備多語言支援，包括英文、法文、意大利文、西班牙文、德文、日文、中文、俄文及荷蘭文，官方稱已在 Windows 7 或以上系統完成測試。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】中世紀角鬥士爭霸 Gladiator Blades Of Fury 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Ss-Cf05ad3cd4d6d7491ab9d079597cc05e401abc18-1920x1080-1.jpg\" width=\"1920\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】中世紀角鬥士爭霸 Gladiator Blades Of Fury 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Ss-4bf2de6b35147615173b923322221b365fec9429-1920x1080-1.jpg\" width=\"1920\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】中世紀角鬥士爭霸 Gladiator Blades Of Fury 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Ss-48e9178e2251e6c7b72d979b453fb4c842aba67d-1920x1080-1.jpg\" width=\"1920\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】中世紀角鬥士爭霸 Gladiator Blades Of Fury 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"810\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Page-Bg-Raw.jpg\" width=\"1438\"/></figure>\n<p>遊戲名稱：Gladiator Blades Of Fury<br/>支援平台：Windows<br/>領取位置：<a href=\"https://store.epicgames.com/p/gladiator-blades-of-fury-1a745b\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Epic Games</a></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:47.311730+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":506,"images":4,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T12:38:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T13:39:02.904728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:03.107730+00:00","content_hash":"73f3a91a8d9e1bfa3a8cbfd80c7615f8352edeee3d70f5e4c4cc922b7aaee602","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}